1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,463
Honey Bunny Kidz presents:

2
00:00:03,463 --> 00:00:05,625
Pip Puppy's Big Leaf Pile!

3
00:00:05,975 --> 00:00:08,400
Let's play in the autumn leaves!

4
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:12,594
It was a cool,

5
00:00:12,594 --> 00:00:14,175
sunny autumn day.

6
00:00:14,525 --> 00:00:17,900
Mama Bunny took Honey and Pip to the park.

7
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:21,555
Leaves were falling from the trees,

8
00:00:21,555 --> 00:00:22,625
one by one.

9
00:00:23,375 --> 00:00:24,222
Woof! Look!

10
00:00:24,222 --> 00:00:26,098
The leaves are dancing down!

11
00:00:26,848 --> 00:00:27,845
Swish, swish!

12
00:00:27,845 --> 00:00:31,023
Can you wiggle your fingers like falling leaves?

13
00:00:33,023 --> 00:00:34,466
Wiggle, wiggle,

14
00:00:34,466 --> 00:00:35,748
down they go!

15
00:00:38,398 --> 00:00:39,998
Crunch, crunch!

16
00:00:40,498 --> 00:00:43,690
What sound do the leaves make when I step on them?

17
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:46,928
Crunch, crunch!

18
00:00:46,928 --> 00:00:49,265
The leaves are dry and crunchy.

19
00:00:50,015 --> 00:00:51,353
I have a big idea!

20
00:00:51,353 --> 00:00:53,966
Let's make the biggest leaf pile ever!

21
00:00:56,616 --> 00:00:58,630
What a fun idea, Pip.

22
00:00:58,630 --> 00:01:02,491
A big job is easier when we do it together.

23
00:01:03,241 --> 00:01:05,473
I can do it all by myself!

24
00:01:05,823 --> 00:01:07,765
I am super fast!

25
00:01:10,415 --> 00:01:13,840
Pip pushed the leaves together, very fast.

26
00:01:14,190 --> 00:01:16,390
Swish, swish, swish!

27
00:01:17,140 --> 00:01:19,037
Look! My leaf pile!

28
00:01:19,787 --> 00:01:21,787
Whoooosh!

29
00:01:22,287 --> 00:01:26,112
Oh! A puff of wind blew the little leaf pile away.

30
00:01:28,762 --> 00:01:30,456
Hey! Come back, leaves!

31
00:01:30,456 --> 00:01:31,173
Hee hee!

32
00:01:31,923 --> 00:01:35,517
Hmm. Maybe a big leaf pile needs lots of helpers.

33
00:01:36,267 --> 00:01:37,932
We can help you, Pip!

34
00:01:37,932 --> 00:01:39,667
Let's ask our friends.

35
00:01:42,317 --> 00:01:44,742
Quack! Can we help too?

36
00:01:45,492 --> 00:01:48,215
Baa! I love autumn leaves!

37
00:01:48,965 --> 00:01:50,770
Let's all work together.

38
00:01:50,770 --> 00:01:52,576
I will use the big rake,

39
00:01:52,576 --> 00:01:54,715
and you can carry the leaves.

40
00:01:55,465 --> 00:01:57,452
Yay! Thank you, friends!

41
00:02:00,102 --> 00:02:01,471
I found a leaf!

42
00:02:01,471 --> 00:02:03,450
What colour is my leaf?

43
00:02:05,450 --> 00:02:06,981
Red! A red leaf,

44
00:02:06,981 --> 00:02:08,753
like a shiny apple.

45
00:02:09,503 --> 00:02:12,878
My leaf is the colour of the sun.

46
00:02:13,228 --> 00:02:15,403
What colour is it?

47
00:02:17,403 --> 00:02:19,828
Yellow! A yellow leaf!

48
00:02:22,478 --> 00:02:24,094
My leaf is orange,

49
00:02:24,094 --> 00:02:25,478
like a pumpkin.

50
00:02:26,228 --> 00:02:27,771
And my leaf is brown,

51
00:02:27,771 --> 00:02:29,443
like a cosy tree trunk.

52
00:02:30,193 --> 00:02:31,478
Red, yellow,

53
00:02:31,478 --> 00:02:33,193
orange and brown.

54
00:02:33,543 --> 00:02:35,993
Autumn is so colourful!

55
00:02:38,643 --> 00:02:39,950
Look at these leaves.

56
00:02:39,950 --> 00:02:41,366
How many can you count?

57
00:02:43,866 --> 00:02:45,317
Let's count together.

58
00:02:45,317 --> 00:02:47,192
One, two, three, four, five!

59
00:02:47,942 --> 00:02:49,010
Five leaves!

60
00:02:49,010 --> 00:02:50,792
Into the pile they go!

61
00:02:53,442 --> 00:02:54,794
Mama Bunny raked,

62
00:02:54,794 --> 00:02:57,092
and the friends carried leaves.

63
00:02:57,442 --> 00:03:00,142
The pile grew bigger and bigger.

64
00:03:00,492 --> 00:03:03,117
Let's sing the Leaf Pile Song!

65
00:03:03,867 --> 00:03:05,163
Crunch, crunch,

66
00:03:05,163 --> 00:03:06,892
leaves on the ground!

67
00:03:07,242 --> 00:03:10,117
Red and yellow, falling down!

68
00:03:10,867 --> 00:03:13,392
Rake them up, one, two, three!

69
00:03:13,742 --> 00:03:16,467
A big leaf pile for you and me!

70
00:03:17,217 --> 00:03:18,357
Stomp your feet!

71
00:03:18,357 --> 00:03:19,918
Crunch, crunch, crunch!

72
00:03:21,418 --> 00:03:22,714
Crunch, crunch,

73
00:03:22,714 --> 00:03:24,443
leaves on the ground!

74
00:03:24,793 --> 00:03:27,668
Red and yellow, falling down!

75
00:03:28,418 --> 00:03:30,943
Rake them up, one, two, three!

76
00:03:31,293 --> 00:03:34,018
A big leaf pile for you and me!

77
00:03:34,768 --> 00:03:37,379
Twirl around like a leaf in the wind!

78
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:43,223
Wow! Our leaf pile is so big!

79
00:03:43,973 --> 00:03:46,498
Before we jump, let's check.

80
00:03:46,848 --> 00:03:49,873
Only soft leaves, no sticks.

81
00:03:50,223 --> 00:03:53,123
And a grown-up is always close by.

82
00:03:53,873 --> 00:03:55,495
Who should jump first?

83
00:03:55,495 --> 00:03:55,949
Hmm.

84
00:03:56,699 --> 00:03:58,338
Dotty is the smallest.

85
00:03:58,338 --> 00:03:59,846
Dotty, you go first!

86
00:04:00,596 --> 00:04:02,123
Thank you, Pip!

87
00:04:02,123 --> 00:04:03,396
Quack! Whee!

88
00:04:04,146 --> 00:04:05,146
Crunch!

89
00:04:07,646 --> 00:04:09,121
Then Lulu jumped,

90
00:04:09,121 --> 00:04:10,596
and Honey jumped.

91
00:04:10,946 --> 00:04:13,121
And then it was Pip's turn.

92
00:04:13,471 --> 00:04:15,746
One, two, three, jump!

93
00:04:16,496 --> 00:04:17,496
Crunch!

94
00:04:17,896 --> 00:04:19,268
Where did Pip go?

95
00:04:19,268 --> 00:04:20,571
Can you see him?

96
00:04:24,471 --> 00:04:25,527
Here I am!

97
00:04:25,527 --> 00:04:26,502
Peekaboo!

98
00:04:27,252 --> 00:04:27,997
Hee hee!

99
00:04:27,997 --> 00:04:30,502
You have leaves on your ears, Pip!

100
00:04:31,252 --> 00:04:34,266
You look like a little leafy tree!

101
00:04:36,916 --> 00:04:38,631
Let's be tall trees.

102
00:04:38,631 --> 00:04:41,616
Stand up and reach your arms up high.

103
00:04:43,216 --> 00:04:45,323
Now sway in the wind,

104
00:04:45,323 --> 00:04:46,991
slow and gentle.

105
00:04:48,791 --> 00:04:52,166
Let your leaves fall down, down, down.

106
00:04:53,666 --> 00:04:56,266
Breathe in the cool autumn air.

107
00:04:58,066 --> 00:04:59,715
And breathe out,

108
00:04:59,715 --> 00:05:01,191
nice and slow.

109
00:05:04,891 --> 00:05:07,378
Making the leaf pile was the most fun,

110
00:05:07,378 --> 00:05:09,199
because we did it together!

111
00:05:09,949 --> 00:05:11,510
That's right, Pip.

112
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:13,368
When we work together,

113
00:05:13,368 --> 00:05:15,524
big jobs are easy and fun.

114
00:05:16,274 --> 00:05:19,524
Then they raked the leaves into a big pile again,

115
00:05:19,524 --> 00:05:21,899
so the next friends could play too.

116
00:05:24,549 --> 00:05:27,749
Helping hands make the best leaf piles.

117
00:05:28,499 --> 00:05:32,599
Share with a friend and subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

118
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:34,801
Woof! Bye-bye, friends!

119
00:05:34,801 --> 00:05:37,328
See you next time on Honey Bunny Kidz!
